sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as Bale
    participant H as Bot Handler
    participant D as Domain Service
    participant DB as Application DB

    U->>B: Press inline button
    B->>H: callback_query update
    H->>H: Parse bounded untrusted callback_data
    H->>D: Load resource and authenticated actor
    D->>D: Check ownership, permission and current state
    alt Action is allowed
        D->>DB: Commit state transition and audit
        DB-->>D: Commit result
        D-->>H: Action result
    else Action is denied
        D-->>H: Reject action
    end
    H->>B: answerCallbackQuery
